# darksamus_phazon.py: the phazon enrage helpers by statecall. PhazonRise's Activate first keeps the
# base box 0x102C the scaled collision box is made from. The sphere sits at the root locator, which
# PreRender reads: so the actor is placed 3 units in front (in view), grown to a sphere that reaches
# the player, and the statecall comes 3 frames after the place. dt 0 first (every dt <= 0 arm), the
# frame with no sphere, the sphere made and kept, two volley Activates (the second has 0xFB8 clear:
# the pulse window), the type-8 waypoint (u066d), contact unmorphed (the visor effect made, then
# kept), gated, far, morphed, the absorbed-shots force (dt 0.0123), the null tweak (0.0124), growth past 5 and the shrink
# (partial, clamped, at the floor), a dt of -10 (PhazonEnraged's blend under 0), and PhazonAttack's reset with and without an emitter.
@f600 send u04f7 Activate; god 1
@f640 statecall u04f7 PhazonRise 0
@f650 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0; statecall u04f7 PhazonFall 1 0
@f652 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016; statecall u04f7 PhazonFall 1 0.016
@f654 statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 0; statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 0
@f656 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 0; statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 0; statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 0
@f658 hint u066d 8; statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016; statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 2 0.016
@f760 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016
@f780 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.0124
@f790 statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 1.5
@f800 place u04f7 player 3
@f803 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016
@f806 place u04f7 player 3
@f809 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016
@f850 place u04f7 player 3
@f853 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016
@f900 place u04f7 90 400 165
@f903 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016
@f910 press X 8
@f1000 place u04f7 player 3
@f1003 statecall u04f7 PhazonMissiles 1 0.016; status
@f1010 press X 8
@f1060 statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 0.0123; statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 0.016
@f1100 statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 6; statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 0.016
@f1110 statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 -10; statecall u04f7 PhazonEnraged 1 0.016
@f1150 statecall u04f7 PhazonFall 1 0.5; statecall u04f7 PhazonFall 1 10; statecall u04f7 PhazonFall 1 0.016
@f1200 statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 0 0.016; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 2 0.016
@f1220 statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 0 0.0123; statecall u04f7 PhazonAttack 2 0.016
@f1300 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f1400 objs dark
